LL}(\\\\mathbf g)=\\\\sum_{p'}[\\\\mathsf L_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\mathbf \
g)]_{pp'}\\\\gamma^{p'}_{\\\\rm LL}$, where $[\\\\mathsf L_{\\\\rm \
