   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<T2-DATA-1\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<the numbers of the figures agree with the data files written \
by the original program t2_fields: the 48 eigenvalues of the lattice operator \
and the 802 points of the curves of Figure 1 (tolerance 5.1e-11, half a unit \
