2 has the 41 output times of GS-13 (tolerance 5.1e-5), and its relative \
deviations from the exact solution are below 1e-13 at x_LL^0 = 0, stay below \
1e-9 for rtol = 1e-12, and their largest values decrease from rtol = 1e-8 to \
1e-10 to 1e-12, as the original check GS-13 states\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
