the relative residual within the fraction 5.1e-7; the charges, branches, \
numbers of levels and of eigenvalues and the sources are equal; the \
probabilities P_up and P_hole of the integrated states, computed here with \
IDA and in the files with CVODE, differ by at most 4 (max_deviation of IDA + \
